","typography_typography":"custom"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"145a3de","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<ol start="1"><li><ol start="1"><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong>Call or text BP Towing</strong> – Tell us your vehicle type, location, and situation. Be specific: "2021 Lamborghini Huracan" not just "sports car."</p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong>We ask detailed questions</strong> – Ground clearance? Air suspension? Modifications? Running or not running? Keys available? This ensures we bring the right equipment.</p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong>We dispatch the right truck</strong> – Extended flatbed for long vehicles. Low-angle ramps for lowered cars. Extra straps for heavy trucks.</p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong>We arrive and assess</strong> – We inspect your vehicle together (if possible) and document existing condition. We confirm the loading plan with you.</p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong>We load with extreme care</strong> – Slow, controlled loading. Wood blocks or low ramps for clearance. Soft straps on approved anchor points. No rushing.</p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong>We secure and transport</strong> – Multiple straps, checked and rechecked. Gentle driving – no hard braking or aggressive corners.</p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong>We unload at destination</strong> – Same careful process in reverse. You inspect the vehicle before we leave.</p></li></ol></li></ol>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size_tablet":{"unit":"px","size":13,"sizes":[]},"paragraph_spacing":{"unit":"px","size":10,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"9715094","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","content_width":"full","width":{"unit":"%","size":"50"}},"elements":[{"id":"7b3c2bf","elType":"widget","settings":{"image":{"url":"https://bptowingservice.ca/w