p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong>Assessment</strong> – We evaluate your stuck situation: how deep, what surface, angle of pull needed, anchor points on your vehicle.</p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong>Positioning</strong> – Our winch truck is positioned for the safest, most effective pull. Sometimes straight back. Sometimes at an angle. Sometimes from the side.</p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong>Attachment</strong> – We attach soft straps or a winch line to proper recovery points on your vehicle. Never to bumpers, axles, or suspension components.</p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong>Controlled pull</strong> – The winch pulls slowly and steadily. We may use a snatch block to change direction or increase pulling power.</p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong>Freedom</strong> – Once your vehicle is on solid ground, we disconnect and you drive away. If your vehicle is damaged or won't start, we can tow you instead.</p></li></ol>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size_tablet":{"unit":"px","size":13,"sizes":[]},"paragraph_spacing":{"unit":"px","size":10,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true},{"id":"e2f3af8","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","content_width":"full","width":{"unit":"%","size":"50"}},"elements":[{"id":"799cb3f","elType":"widget","settings":{"image":{"url":"https://bptowingservice.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/winch-out-services-nearby.jpg","id":1207,"size":"","alt":"","source":"library"},"image_size":"full","image_border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"10","right":"10","bottom":"10","left":"10","isLinked":true},"image_custom_dimension":{"width":"600","height":"400"},"width":{"unit":"%","size":100,"sizes":[]},"sticky":"top","sticky_on":["desktop","tablet"],"sticky_parent":"yes"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"image"}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":false},{"id":"953a0b1","elType":"container","settings":[],"elements":[{"id":"db