 <span>Assistance in Calgary</span>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":40,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":30,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height_mobile":{"unit":"em","size":1.2,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"0f641db","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p class="ds-markdown-paragraph">You have choices when searching for "roadside assistance near me." Here's why Calgary drivers pick BP Towing:</p><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong>Fast response times</strong> – Our service vehicles are positioned across the city. When you call, we dispatch the nearest available technician. Most calls receive a <strong>20‑ to 35‑minute arrival time</strong> in normal conditions.</p><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong>Certified technicians</strong> – Every team member is trained in safe roadside procedures. We don't send untrained drivers. You get someone who knows how to boost a hybrid battery, change a tire on a steep shoulder, or unlock a modern vehicle without triggering the alarm.</p><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong>Well‑equipped service vehicles</strong> – Our trucks carry heavy‑duty jumper cables, portable jump packs, air compressors, tire repair kits, lockout tools, winching gear, and extra fuel. We arrive ready for almost anything.</p><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong>Upfront pricing</strong> – We tell you the cost before we start any work. No hidden fees, no "service call" surprises, no after‑hours markups. Just honest, transparent rates.</p><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong>24/7 availability</strong> – Nights, weekends, Christmas Day, Canada Day – we never close. Emergencies don't take holidays, and neither do we.</p><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong>Wide vehicle support</strong> – We assist cars, SUVs, vans, crossovers, light trucks, and even motorcycles. If you drive it, we can probably help.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","t